  dialogues:
  - speaker: 0
    message: "[gentle chuckle] Mortal, speechlessness is not a crime.\n[curious tone]
      Tell me\u2014what creatures do humans admire now?\nPok\xE9mon, yes? Which one
      holds your favor?"
    emotion: 0
  - speaker: 1
    message: "Hmph\u2026\nIf the mortal can\u2019t speak, give them something simple.\n[leans
      in] Fine\u2014what food keeps you alive these days?\nBread? Meat? Something
      strange from your time?"
    emotion: 0
